## Input

```css
@mixin animation($name) {
  @keyframes #{$name} {
    // The content statement remains an outer keyframe item.
    @content; // After the content statement.
  }
}

@include animation(pulse) {
  from { opacity: 0; }
  to { opacity: 1; }
}

.after-content {
  color: red;
}

```


